  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "轉機"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>陳泓宇</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一个少年家去山頂揣老和尚，tn̄g--著了後……</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">少年家問講：「師父！我感覺tsit-má我ê生活，無啥順利。我應該按怎khah好？」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">老和尚kā應：「你上好行--出-去，去khah遠ê所在行行看看--leh。比如南美洲，相信你ē拄著轉機……」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">少年家聽了，隨回講：「Kám án-ne？是啥mih款ê轉機？」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">老和尚笑笑仔應講：「Tī歐洲轉機……」</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">（Tsit篇文章是高雄市岡山社區大學「手寫台文、口說台語」班ê學生投稿）</p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjkkfplyCmdT3ssLIpZDIE-bsEu0bs0Z_Ceb8OXLYJJNBYhkBVhZAOvSokH2xsHgTXs79WoDYLd4jvnRDy7zTm7pV7ier9J-8GDiyUvXg_MFRhkz7qcf_nUP41UB7fdIAExE2bbkjeqd81SNpYxBQPFYP3JWn5_GE9kFKWlYlM_5Hn9-GufXWP9fckJx5Nh/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1359%E6%9C%9F_019_b.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjkkfplyCmdT3ssLIpZDIE-bsEu0bs0Z_Ceb8OXLYJJNBYhkBVhZAOvSokH2xsHgTXs79WoDYLd4jvnRDy7zTm7pV7ier9J-8GDiyUvXg_MFRhkz7qcf_nUP41UB7fdIAExE2bbkjeqd81SNpYxBQPFYP3JWn5_GE9kFKWlYlM_5Hn9-GufXWP9fckJx5Nh/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1359%E6%9C%9F_019_b.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhDJn1b4-aXdPVniou3PG9UsKNs2yDx83H9Z7CC2XsRHlFthbhm6ywKTosMqfdYpJgwSi7-4HWM3Mgkt2Qi7Xex7s7scF0zg9EuhNvVaKCLvDy71SWfDIFZW7TFhVJ4a2m-LpqpQdeLHnMqEiOQLfPLj3mK6v4zcGjKg_ugSxTEoucGFAorBXLet8ZSuHA0/s1423/359%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1423\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhDJn1b4-aXdPVniou3PG9UsKNs2yDx83H9Z7CC2XsRHlFthbhm6ywKTosMqfdYpJgwSi7-4HWM3Mgkt2Qi7Xex7s7scF0zg9EuhNvVaKCLvDy71SWfDIFZW7TFhVJ4a2m-LpqpQdeLHnMqEiOQLfPLj3mK6v4zcGjKg_ugSxTEoucGFAorBXLet8ZSuHA0/w450-h640/359%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>#Bóng講笑&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b><br /><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"ba